"s-jinshu-044-zhengmao"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024","text":"大司農沛國桓範聞兵起不應太后召矯詔開平昌門拔取劒㦸略將門候南奔爽宣王知曰範畫䇿爽必不能用範計範説爽使車駕幸許昌招外兵爽兄弟猶豫未决範重謂羲曰當今日卿門戸求貧賤復可得乎且匹夫持質一人尚欲望活今卿與天子相隨令於天下誰敢不應者羲猶不能納侍中許允尚書陳泰説爽使早自歸罪爽於是遣允泰詣宣王歸罪請死乃通宣王奏事","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"桓範","kind":"person","person_id":"vwm_w8o_188","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"tkv_k8m_7hc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024:m0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"爽","kind":"person","person_id":"30k_jzz_tpd_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024:m0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"範","kind":"person","person_id":"vwm_w8o_188","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"爽","kind":"person","person_id":"30k_jzz_tpd_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024:m0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"範","kind":"person","person_id":"vwm_w8o_188","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024:m0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"範","kind":"person","person_id":"vwm_w8o_188","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p024:m0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"爽","kind":"person","person_id":"3